{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is THE Level Editing tool used by the developer of Maze Engine. With this tool, you have full control to design, build, and customize anything possible within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Functionality includes but is not limited to:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep control over maze generation: algorithms, seeds, layers, maze size, cell dimensions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full visual customization: colors, textures, lighting, orientation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full access to  create levels for any game mode available within the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced path design: braiding, masking, and direct cell-by-cell editing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in maze solving, analysis and testing utilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763980?t=1756090485","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763980?t=1756090485","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763980/4d55a11c239e0ead41cc4a464fbe89c7545f1d6a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756090485","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763980/4d55a11c239e0ead41cc4a464fbe89c7545f1d6a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756090485","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is THE Level Editing tool used by the